==Behind the scenes==
The Anomids originated in the [[1989]] [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] [[Wikipedia:Role-playing game|role-playing game]] book "[[Riders of the Maelstrom (adventure)|Riders of the Maelstrom]]."

